00:03:10.336 --> 00:03:13.144
<v Host>It means the open sea, off the coast.

00:03:13.743 --> 00:03:25.503
<v Slow>9月のペルー沖の海面水温は28.9度で、基準の値より4.0度高くなりました。

00:03:26.304 --> 00:03:34.367
<v Host>In September, the sea surface temperature off Peru was twenty-eight point nine degrees, four degrees above the baseline.

00:03:34.967 --> 00:03:37.080
