00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:49.264
<v Host>It means an expectation, or forecast.

00:04:49.863 --> 00:04:59.584
<v Slow>冬の間も、エルニーニョ現象が続く確率は、100パーセントだということです。

00:05:00.384 --> 00:05:05.495
<v Host>The chance that El Nino continues through the winter is one hundred percent.

00:05:06.096 --> 00:05:08.591
