00:06:22.408 --> 00:06:25.240
<v Host>It means to be late, or delayed.

00:06:25.839 --> 00:06:36.759
<v Slow>一方で、低気圧の活動が活発になりやすく、大雨や大雪が降るおそれもあります。

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:44.951
<v Host>On the other hand, low-pressure systems tend to be active, so there is also a risk of heavy rain and heavy snow.

